==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly easy stage, but it could be considered difficult for people who are very early into the game, so try to get at least midway through [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 before attempting this stage.

